{"speciesId":516,"names":{"fr":"Flotoutan","es":"Simipour","en":"Simipour","ja":"ヒヤッキー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il stocke de l’eau dans les mèches de sa tête. Quand il est à sec, il se ravitaille en aspirant de l’eau par la queue."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The tuft on its head holds water. When the level runs low, it replenishes the tuft by siphoning up water with its tail."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le jet d’eau à haute pression qu’il propulse par la queue est assez puissant pour traverser un mur de béton."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The high-pressure water expelled from its tail is so powerful, it can destroy a concrete wall."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le jet d’eau à haute pression qu’il propulse par la queue est assez puissant pour traverser un mur de béton."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando lanza agua a alta presión con su cola, puede incluso resquebrajar una pared de cemento."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The high-pressure water expelled from its tail is so powerful, it can destroy a concrete wall."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"尻尾から 高圧の 水を 発射すると コンクリートの 壁も 破壊する 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il aime les endroits où l’eau est pure. Il se ravitaille en eau en l’aspirant avec sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le encantan los lugares con agua limpia. Cuando desciende el nivel de agua de su pelo, se abastece a través de su cola."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"水が きれいな 場所を 好む。 頭に ためこんだ 水が減ると 尻尾から 吸いあげて 補給。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le jet d’eau à haute pression qu’il propulse par la queue est assez puissant pour traverser un mur de béton."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando lanza agua a alta presión con su cola, puede incluso resquebrajar una pared de cemento."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The high-pressure water expelled from its tail is so powerful, it can destroy a concrete wall."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"尻尾から 高圧の 水を 発射すると コンクリートの 壁も 破壊する 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il aime les endroits où l’eau est pure. Il se ravitaille en eau en l’aspirant avec sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le encantan los lugares con agua limpia. Cuando desciende el nivel de agua de su pelo, se abastece a través de su cola."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"水が きれいな 場所を 好む。 頭に ためこんだ 水が減ると 尻尾から 吸いあげて 補給。"}],"varieties":[{"id":516,"moves":[{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[11,"machine",0],